#. i18n: file: kdeui/sonnet/sonnetui.ui:137
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QListView, m_suggestions)
#: rc.cpp:77 rc.cpp:340
msgid "Suggested Words"
msgstr "Предложени зборови"

